   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dende",
   "text": "Welcome back, Nail."
  },
  {
   "i": 112,
   "start": 292.52,
   "end": 294.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Where... am I?"
  },
  {
   "i": 113,
   "start": 294.16,
   "end": 295.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dende",
   "text": "May I hug you?"
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "start": 295.06,
   "end": 295.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "NO!"
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "start": 295.64,
   "end": 296.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dende",
   "text": "Oh..."
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "start": 297.02,
   "end": 297.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Gohan!"
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "start": 297.84,
   "end": 300.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "Aaaahhh? Mr. Piccolo!"
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "start": 300.06,
   "end": 302.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "...And Dende...? But, I thought that--"
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "start": 302.78,
   "end": 304.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dende",
   "text": "Turns out that we're all alive!"
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "start": 304.38,
   "end": 307.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dende",
   "text": "Except for Krillin! How unfortunate..."
  },
  {
   "i": 121,
   "start": 307.68,
   "end": 309.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Naiiilll!"
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "start": 309.36,
   "end": 311.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Naaiiiilll!"
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "start": 311.58,
   "end": 313.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "NAAAAIIIIIIILLL!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "start": 313.9,
   "end": 315.46,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "'I think he's looking for you.'"
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "start": 315.46,
   "end": 317.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Nail",
   "text": "'Do NOT tell him I'm here!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "start": 317.14,
   "end": 320.66,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Nail! I can sense YOOOUUUUU!"
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "start": 320.66,
   "end": 322.08,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Nail",
   "text": "'Do NOT make eye-contact!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "start": 322.08,
   "end": 328.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Gohan",
   "text": "You know, looking around, it seems like the only people who were brought back were those killed by Freeza and his men..."
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "start": 328.22,
   "end": 330.16,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Piccolo",
   "text": "Huh... well, that's convenient."
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "start": 331.04,
   "end": 333.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekian 1",
   "text": "Sir, we cannot find the Tagrok tribe."
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "start": 333.22,
   "end": 336.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekian 2",
   "text": "Wait - you mean that one guy who really liked showing off his Dragon Ball?"
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "start": 336.38,
   "end": 338.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekian 1",
   "text": "Yeah. THAT dumbass."
  },
  {
   "i": 133,
   "start": 338.0,
   "end": 338.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Bulma",
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 134,
   "start": 338.0,
   "end": 343.14,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Oh! I wonder what sort of dashing, handsome rogue could have been responsible for their deaths?"
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "start": 338.78,
   "end": 339.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Dende",
   "text": "Ahh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 136,
   "start": 339.7,
   "end": 341.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekians",
   "text": "(Gasp)"
  },
  {
   "i": 137,
   "start": 343.54,
   "end": 345.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Vegeta",
   "text": "Oh, wait! It was me!"
  },
  {
   "i": 138,
   "start": 345.78,
   "end": 347.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "HA! Nice!"
  },
  {
   "i": 139,
   "start": 347.88,
   "end": 350.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekian 3",
   "text": "He massacred an entire village!"
  },
  {
   "i": 140,
   "start": 350.04,
   "end": 355.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Yeah, I'm gonna be honest with you... I don't really like any of you..."
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "start": 355.86,
   "end": 356.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "except him. (Namekian in blue)"
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "start": 361.78,
   "end": 362.46,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "SPLAT"
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "start": 362.94,
   "end": 365.88,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "HA! Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!"
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "start": 365.88,
   "end": 367.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Ha-- (Gagging)"
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "start": 367.68,
   "end": 370.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Oh, God...! Actually dying this time!"
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "start": 370.6,
   "end": 373.18,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Namekians gasp"
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "start": 370.6,
   "end": 373.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekian 4",
   "text": "Lord Guru! You can't leave us!"
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "start": 373.18,
   "end": 380.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "I'm sorry, my children... but I must leave you now. My time is at an end..."
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "start": 375.46,
   "end": 380.62,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Namekians cry en-masse"
  },
  {
   "i": 150,
   "start": 380.62,
   "end": 384.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "but before I leave, I must confess my sins..."
  },
  {
   "i": 151,
   "start": 384.52,
   "end": 385.72,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekian 4",
   "text": "What do you mean?"
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "start": 385.92,
   "end": 389.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Do you remember the great drought that befell our planet?"
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "start": 389.78,
   "end": 391.64,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Mouri",
   "text": "The one that nearly wiped out our race?"
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "start": 391.64,
   "end": 392.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Yeah..."
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "start": 392.42,
   "end": 394.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekian 5",
   "text": "The one caused by those filthy albinos?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "start": 394.9,
   "end": 395.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Yeahhhh...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "start": 395.78,
   "end": 398.02,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekian 3",
   "text": "The ones we purged as per your instruction?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "start": 398.02,
   "end": 403.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "YEAAHH, SEEEE... I might have shifted the blame on that one..."
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "start": 404.48,
   "end": 405.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Mouri",
   "text": "...You *what*?"
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "start": 405.48,
   "end": 411.42,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Remember when I said THEY were the ones responsible for the disappearance of our precious water?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "start": 411.42,
   "end": 413.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekian 4",
   "text": "We slaughtered thousands!"
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "start": 413.54,
   "end": 415.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "It was ME."
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "start": 415.0,
   "end": 415.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekian 5",
   "text": "How?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "start": 415.68,
   "end": 417.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "I drank it!"
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "start": 417.0,
   "end": 417.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Namekian 3",
   "text": "Whaa--?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "start": 417.6,
   "end": 420.76,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "How do you think I got so FAAAT?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "start": 420.76,
   "end": 422.02,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Namekians shocked into silence"
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "start": 422.02,
   "end": 426.06,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "And now, I can die with a clear conscience..."
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "start": 426.34,
   "end": 428.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "(Groaning)"
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "start": 429.48,
   "end": 430.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Uhhh..."
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "start": 430.94,
   "end": 432.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "(Frantic groaning)"
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "start": 433.1,
   "end": 433.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Uh-oh..."
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "start": 433.7,
   "end": 434.4,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Mouri",
   "text": "KILL HIM!"
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "start": 434.4,
   "end": 437.48,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Angry mob charge at Guru"
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "start": 434.4,
   "end": 437.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Noooo! NAILLLLLLLL!!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "start": 437.48,
   "end": 443.56,
   "kind": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Angry mob hack Guru to pieces"
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "start": 437.48,
   "end": 443.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Guru",
   "text": "Choke on them...! Choke on them...! Choke on them...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "start": 448.3,
   "end": 449.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "HIYAAH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "start": 449.1,
   "end": 449.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "HIYAGH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "start": 449.62,
   "end": 450.2,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "AAGH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "start": 454.46,
   "end": 456.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "'Hrrrr! Dirty monkey--!'"
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "start": 456.6,
   "end": 457.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Da-uh?! Where--?"
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "start": 458.1,
   "end": 460.18,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "...oh my God, you could grind meat on th--"
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "start": 460.18,
   "end": 460.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "BAAH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "start": 463.58,
   "end": 464.28,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I'm done."
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "start": 464.86,
   "end": 465.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "What?"
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "start": 465.44,
   "end": 469.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I'm done fighting you. I'm bored. You're boring me."
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "start": 469.44,
   "end": 469.94,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Wha--?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "start": 470.28,
   "end": 473.68,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "...Oh-ho, I get it! You're *scared*, aren't you?!"
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "start": 473.68,
   "end": 478.32,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Afraid knowing that this planet only has one minute left before it explodes!"
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "start": 478.82,
   "end": 479.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Question."
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "start": 479.34,
   "end": 479.84,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "start": 480.16,
   "end": 481.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Do you have a watch?"
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "start": 481.36,
   "end": 483.0,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "No-oooo; why?"
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "start": 483.0,
   "end": 484.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Do you know what a minute is?"
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "start": 484.66,
   "end": 486.62,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "What...? Of course I do!"
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "start": 486.62,
   "end": 487.9,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "I don't think you do."
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "start": 487.9,
   "end": 489.38,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Uh--... but... er..."
  },
  {
   "i": 199,
   "start": 489.38,
   "end": 492.36,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Anyway, I'ma leave now. (Sigh)"
  },
  {
   "i": 200,
   "start": 492.36,
   "end": 494.04,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Augh, ugh..."
  },
  {
   "i": 201,
   "start": 492.36,
   "end": 495.12,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Try not to blow up anymore planets... else I'ma hafta kill ya."
  },
  {
   "i": 202,
   "start": 496.1,
   "end": 499.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "You can't just... We're not...! *You little*...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 203,
   "start": 499.8,
   "end": 502.24,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Hraaaghh...! Hey, monkey!"
  },
  {
   "i": 204,
   "start": 502.52,
   "end": 504.56,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "You forgot your *pizza*!"
  },
  {
   "i": 205,
   "start": 504.56,
   "end": 505.86,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Oh yeah, thanks for reminding me--"
  },
  {
   "i": 206,
   "start": 508.82,
   "end": 510.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "...That's not a pizza...!"
  },
  {
   "i": 207,
   "start": 511.14,
   "end": 513.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "That's not a pizza at ALL!"
  },
  {
   "i": 208,
   "start": 514.24,
   "end": 515.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Now, to end this!"
  },
  {
   "i": 209,
   "start": 517.3,
   "end": 521.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "I... uh-huh? Oh, come on now, I... d'agh! This blasted thing!"
  },
  {
   "i": 210,
   "start": 521.96,
   "end": 523.78,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "What are you doing down there??"
  },
  {
   "i": 211,
   "start": 523.78,
   "end": 526.98,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "You trying to swat a bee? 'Cause I don't like bees."
  },
  {
   "i": 212,
   "start": 526.98,
   "end": 533.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "No, don't worry, I'm just... d'ugh! What is going *on*?! What are these; inverted controls?! Who even uses--"
  },
  {
   "i": 213,
   "start": 533.56,
   "end": 534.7,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "D'ah! Got it!"
  },
  {
   "i": 214,
   "start": 535.28,
   "end": 535.96,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Damn it!"
  },
  {
   "i": 215,
   "start": 535.96,
   "end": 538.34,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "So are you just stealing Krillin's attacks now?"
  },
  {
   "i": 216,
   "start": 538.34,
   "end": 544.22,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Or should I watch out for the Tri-Beam? Or the Garlic Gun? Or the Makakapotamus?"
  },
  {
   "i": 217,
   "start": 544.22,
   "end": 544.8,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "HIYAH!"
  },
  {
   "i": 218,
   "start": 544.98,
   "end": 545.54,
   "kind": "sfx",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "ZCHNNG"
  },
  {
   "i": 219,
   "start": 545.54,
   "end": 546.6,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "GOTCHA, BITCH!!"
  },
  {
   "i": 220,
   "start": 547.02,
   "end": 547.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
   "i": 221,
   "start": 548.36,
   "end": 549.1,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Iyerrgh!"
  },
  {
   "i": 222,
   "start": 549.44,
   "end": 553.48,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Goku",
   "text": "Don't feel bad. Krillin never hits anyone with it either. Anyway, you done?"
  },
  {
   "i": 223,
   "start": 553.48,
   "end": 557.44,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
   "text": "Oh, far from it. I just remembered - I promised you TWO PIZZAS!"
  },
  {
   "i": 224,
   "start": 562.84,
   "end": 567.52,
   "kind": "dialog",
   "speaker": "Freeza",
