  },
  {
   "start": 421.6,
   "end": 444.0,
   "title": "Choke On Them",
   "quote": "KILL HIM! / Noooo! NAILLLLLLLL!!! / Choke on them...! Choke on them...! Choke on them...!",
   "line_start": 168,
   "line_end": 177
  },
  {
   "start": 463.1,
   "end": 495.2,
   "title": "Do You Know What a Minute Is?",
   "quote": "I'm done fighting you. I'm bored. You're boring me. / Do you have a watch? / Do you know what a minute is? / I don't think you do.",
   "line_start": 185,
   "line_end": 201
  },
  {
