  },
  {
   "start": 526.5,
   "end": 553.5,
   "title": "Gotcha, Bitch",
   "quote": "Or should I watch out for the Tri-Beam? Or the Garlic Gun? Or the Makakapotamus? / GOTCHA, BITCH!! / Krillin never hits anyone with it either.",
